6. May be an image of flag, poster and text that says 'BestWihes HILTON REALTORS 能I南SRE BUYING BUYINGSELLINGLEASE SELLING LEASE im 催！ th 15Aug 15 Aug HAPPY INDEPENDENCE Wishing you the colors of our flag fill your ife with joy this Independence Day! DAY'.](https://scontent-iev1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/775834655_17998571187004203_7034158907023244272_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=5W81bPqtTH0Q7kNvwEw_qKC&_nc_oc=AdpHgXq0YB7T_-FEPD3oDkZvTGCbsL9iq0T_MPsrgDso4sqBOzk9yzArCDAPvqWNUE8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iev1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=ZH0bXkqMi9mc8oXPTVN-2g&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQILav6PeEsecnuyK27gVFc3Px4kgZM-xx1lFtYbg0jAMg&oe=6AA5C9B1)](/hiltonrealtors01/reel/DcDGWp_MPQf/)\n\n[See more posts](/hiltonrealtors01/)\n\n---","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/gitanjali-tatva/6095/project","title":"Gitanjali Tatva, Borivali East, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹2.42 Cr Onwards | 3, 4 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Gitanjali developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/gitanjali-group-1118.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Gitanjali Tatva Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Gitanjali Tatva Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/gitanjali-tatva-project-large-image3.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Gitanjali Tatva Project Thumbnail Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/gitanjali-tatva-project-large-image3-thumb.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Gitanjali Tatva Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/gitanjali-tatva-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.42 Cr - 2.97 Cr**\n\n₹25,751 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About Gitanjali Tatva, Borivali East by Gitanjali\n\n## Gitanjali Tatva Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Gitanjali Tatva.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  987 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.42 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1214 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.97 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nGitanjali Tatva's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali East.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Gitanjali Tatva | Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 31450 | 35200 |\n| Mar 2026 | 31300 | 34750 |\n| Dec 2025 | 31500 | 32450 |\n| Sep 2025 | 34100 | 30650 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nGitanjali Tatva avg. price is ₹ 31.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali East at ₹ 35.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Oberoi Tata Steel](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/oberoi-tata-steel/26388/project \"Oberoi Tata Steel\") | ₹ 37,300 |\n| Borivali East | ₹ 35,200 |\n| [Mayfair Shyam](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mayfair-shyam/28139/project \"Mayfair Shyam\") | ₹ 34,450 |\n| Current Project **Gitanjali Tatva** | ₹ 31,450 |\n| [Paradigm Revive](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-revive/107077/project \"Paradigm Revive\") | ₹ 29,100 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Gitanjali Tatva start from ₹ 79 K with options available for 3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Gitanjali Tatva | In Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 31.8 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 46.2 K |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 79 K | ₹ 98.6 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.5 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Gitanjali Tatva.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Gitanjali Tatva, amounting to ₹ 3 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### Thane Infrastructure and Development Updates\n\nThe Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel project saw the launch of TBM Arjuna on August 13, 2026, aiming to reduce travel time between Thane and Borivali to approximately 15 minutes. Amazon Data Services is developing a large data center in Ambernath, with an estimated construction cost of ₹3,500 crore, to be ready by 2029\n\n#### Mumbai Boosts Connectivity with Santacruz - Chembur link road Phase 2 & Chembur Metro Station\n\nCM Devendra Fadnavis inaugurated Phase 2 of the Santacruz-Chembur Link Road (SCLR) & the Chembur Metro Station under Metro Line 2B,The SCLR Phase 2 is expected to strengthen the road network between Mumbai's western and eastern suburbs, improving east-west connectivity.\n\n#### Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel Project: Traffic Diversions Announced in Kasarvadavali\n\nTemporary traffic diversions have been implemented in Kasarvadavali for the ongoing work on the ambitious Thane-Borivali twin tunnel project by the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA). Certain routes will be closed from July 6 to August 5, 2026, to facilitate construction.\n\n#### Mumbai Monorail Services to Resume After Nine-Month Hiatus\n\nMumbai's monorail services are set to resume soon after a nine-month suspension, following approval from the Maharashtra government for safety improvements and fare revisions. MMRDA has proposed increased ticket prices. The monorail, which previously carried around 18,000 passengers daily, will offer improved services after safety upgrades.\n\nRent in Gitanjali Tatva ranges from ₹ 72 K to ₹ 88 K with options available for 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Gitanjali Tatva moved from ₹ 31,300/sqft to ₹ 31,450/sqft, reflecting a 0.48% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Gitanjali Tatva From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 26.3 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 3 Cr | ₹ 26,300 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Gitanjali Tatva Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 987 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Gitanjali Tatva, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/gitanjali-tatva-apartment-3bhk-987sqft-20204120114147.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.42 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 4 BHK 1214 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Gitanjali Tatva, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.97 Cr\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Gitanjali Tatva\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Gitanjali Tatva, Mumbai.\n\n![2.5 BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room,Study Room,Basement,Store Room Apartment For Sale in Gitanjali Tatva in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Gitanjali Tatva in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![2.5