perty/gitanjali-tatva/6095/project \"Gitanjali Tatva\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Sanghvi Solitaire project in Borivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-solitaire-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Sanghvi Solitaire](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sanghvi-solitaire/3501/project \"Sanghvi Solitaire\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Aditya Urvashi project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-aditya-urvashi-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Aditya Urvashi](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/aditya-urvashi/5832/project \"Aditya Urvashi\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Gitanjali Track Record\n\n![Gitanjali logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/gitanjali-group-1118.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nGitanjali Group was founded as a major cutter and polisher of diamonds at Surat in the year 1966. Over time, the Group became a major player in the diamond and jewellery segment. This was the first ever contemporary company in this segment to be spearheaded and managed by two contemporary entrepreneurs instead of belonging to a dynasty or business family. The Gitanjali Group is an authorized DTC Sight holder and is a multinational conglomerate at present dealing in cutting, diamond sourcing, polishing, distribution, jewellery manufacturing, retail and branding. The Group has forayed successfully into newer segments like retail and lifestyle and infrastructure. The Group has come up with a new property division that aims at offering the best possible housing solutions for the customer. There are several new ideas being deliberated when it comes to upcoming property by Gitanjali Group.\n\n![Neminath Kandivali Shiv Krupa CHSL residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-neminath-kandivali-shiv-krupa-chsl-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2,3,4 BHK\n\n₹ 1.75 Cr to 2.83 Cr\n\n![Aditya Urvashi residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-aditya-urvashi-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2,3 BHK\n\n₹ 1.84 Cr to 2.50 Cr\n\n![Oberoi Tata Steel residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-tata-steel-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n3,4 BHK\n\n₹ 2.24 Cr to 2.79 Cr\n\n![Aditya Vilas Vaibhav residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-aditya-vilas-vaibhav-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1,3 BHK\n\n₹ 1.63 Cr to 2.26 Cr\n\n![Yashprabha CHS residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-yashprabha-chs-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1,2,3 BHK\n\n₹ 63.25 Lac to 2.44 Cr\n\n![Kamla Gopal residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kamla-gopal-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2,3 BHK\n\n₹ 1.73 Cr to 2.34 Cr\n\n![Sanghvi Solitaire residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sanghvi-solitaire-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2,3 BHK\n\n₹ 1.89 Cr to 2.57 Cr\n\n![Paradigm Revive residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-paradigm-revive-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1,2,3 B