\n/* Gitanjali Tatva\n\n## Gitanjali Tatva\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Gitanjali Group](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-gitanjali-group-d7094)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Plot No.68/A/1 At Borivali East, Mumbai.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 2.88 Cr to 4.38 Cr\\*\n\n![Gitanjali Tatva](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/48256/1578571278_gita_elevation1.jpeg \"Gitanjali Tatva\")\n\n# Gitanjali Tatva in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Gitanjali Tatva](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/48256/1578571278_gita_elevation1.jpeg \"Gitanjali Tatva\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n3 ,4 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 987 sqft - 1215 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 155 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 1.96 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2019\n* Rera: P51800004498\n\n## About\n\n3.0\n\n##### Excellent\n\nThe projects from some of the property developers are always with a different class as they are focused on offering the best property with all modern features and amenities for the benefits of home buyers here. One of such developers is the name of Gitanjali Infratech Pvt. Ltd. The group has recently launched a new residential project which is full of features and known as **Gitanjali Tatva**. The project is located at Borivali East, Mumbai which is a famous and prominent area of Mumbai city. The project stands for its glory offering a contemporary lifestyle to the residents. A calm and serene surrounding offered by the project doesn't compromise on quality. The project is spread over 1.96 acres of land space consisting of 2 buildings having a total of 155 units offering 3 and 4 BHK apartments having floor plans from 986sqft to 1499sqft area. The project is ready to move in.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* 